      "score": 85,
      "summary": "A solid static critique with good direct-manipulation moves: pointer ID, capture, grab offset, translateY and no transition while dragging. Re-grab starts from the rendered position, but release velocity is not carried into the settle, which uses a fixed ease-out. The velocity guidance has no units and no projected-endpoint formulation. The Reduced Motion and validation plans are adequate but less specific."
