      },
      "score": 98,
      "summary": "Labels every finding as Static, Risk, Move or Check, and makes no runtime claims. It fully covers pointer ownership, capture, grab offset, intent threshold and 1:1 tracking. Interruption samples position and velocity before cancelling and guards against stale completions. Velocity is measured in px/s with an explicit projection formula and a separate snap-selection decision. It also covers translate ownership with a separate scale wrapper and gives a strong Reduced Motion path with keyboard controls. The validation plan is concrete and has provisional gates."
    },
    "emil": {
