        "performance": 10,
        "velocity_projection": 13
      },
      "score": 95,
      "summary": "Labels evidence clearly as Observed, Inferred or Proposed and has a thorough lifecycle: pending, dragging, settling, sampling the visible position before stopping, preserving velocity on retarget, and guarding stale callbacks. It uses bounded velocity projection with hysteresis and a damped spring, but gives no explicit units or projection horizon. It correctly identifies three competing motion mechanisms. The Reduced Motion path and validation plan are strong, with pass criteria."
